  failed on config before ever checking a link — reinstalled with `--with mkdocs-material --with
  mkdocs-mermaid2-plugin --with mkdocs-exclude`. The hook departs from the craft template in three
  ways: it gates on exit code rather than `tail -8` (mkdocs-material prints a ~20-line red banner
  on every build that would bury the result), filters to `*/docs/*` and `mkdocs.yml` (a repo-level
